  "latestPeriod": "2025-26 (financial year)",
  "coverage": "All states' deficits and receipts as a share of India's GDP, 2011-12 to 2025-26, over GDP on the 2011-12 base",
  "note": "RBI, Select fiscal indicators of the state governments, per cent of GDP (DBIE report 454). Per cent of GDP at current market prices, GDP on the 2011-12 base (the RBI's note on its state-indicators table: 1999-2000 base to 2003-04, 2004-05 base to 2010-11, 2011-12 base from 2011-12; the Centre's and the combined tables divide by the same GDP, checked by their implied denominators). A different GDP base is a different ruler: never joined across bundles. The budget estimate for 2025-26 divides by the budget's own GDP projection. Stages, from the printed table's own note: accounts to 2023-24, the revised estimate for 2024-25 and the budget estimate for 2025-26, each in its own series (suffix __re and __be), never one line. Cross-checked against the printed table (Innovation Hub export of Handbook report 269): 530 of 530 figures match."
 },
